---
import { experiences } from '../../data/experiences';
import { profile } from '../../data/profile';

const workExps = experiences.filter((e) => e.type === 'work');
---

<section class="py-20 md:py-28 bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 transition-colors duration-300">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
      <div data-aos="fade-right">
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-50 mb-6">
          안녕하세요!
        </h2>
        <p class="text-lg text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
          사용자 중심의 웹과 애플리케이션을 개발하는 개발자입니다. 새로운
          기술을 배우는 것을 좋아하며, 깔끔하고 유지보수하기 쉬운 코드를
          작성하는 것을 지향합니다.
        </p>
        <p class="text-lg text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 mb-8 leading-relaxed">
          {profile.careerYears}년 이상의 실무 경험을 바탕으로 다양한 도메인의
          프로젝트를 수행해왔습니다.
        </p>
        <a
          href="/about"
          class="inline-flex items-center text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 font-medium hover:text-blue-700 dark:hover:text-blue-300 transition-colors"
        >
          자세히 알아보기
          <svg
            class="w-4 h-4 ml-2"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
          >
            <path
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
              stroke-width="2"
              d="M17 8l4 4m0 0l-4 4m4-4H3"
            />
          </svg>
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4" data-aos="fade-left">
        <div class="p-6 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-800 rounded-xl text-center transition-colors duration-300">
          <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-blue-600 mb-2">
            {workExps.length}+
          </div>
          <div class="text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">업무 프로젝트</div>
        </div>
        <div class="p-6 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-800 rounded-xl text-center transition-colors duration-300">
          <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-blue-600 mb-2">3+</div>
          <div class="text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">기술 스택</div>
        </div>
        <div class="p-6 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-800 rounded-xl text-center transition-colors duration-300">
          <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-blue-600 mb-2">100%</div>
          <div class="text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">열정</div>
        </div>
        <div class="p-6 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-800 rounded-xl text-center transition-colors duration-300">
          <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-blue-600 mb-2">24/7</div>
          <div class="text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">학습</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
